## Inline directives

- Keys: press :kbd[Cmd+Shift+P] to open the command palette.
- Abbreviations: :abbr[WASM]{title="WebAssembly"} runs in the browser.

## Unknown directives

Tools ignore directives they don't know, but still show the content. Vendor directives start with `x-` so they never clash with future standard ones. See the [diagnostics example](diagnostics.yamd) for what the editor reports.
